The legal text
==============

The text of the Acts in this repository is reproduced from the Justice Laws Website (https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca),
Department of Justice Canada, under the Reproduction of Federal Law Order, SI/97-5:

  "Anyone may, without charge or request for permission, reproduce enactments and consolidations of enactments of the
  Government of Canada, and decisions and reasons for decisions of federally-constituted courts and administrative
  tribunals, provided due diligence is exercised in ensuring the accuracy of the materials reproduced and the
  reproduction is not represented as an official version."

This reproduction is NOT an official version. It is not produced in affiliation with, or with the endorsement of, the
Government of Canada. The Department of Justice Canada assumes no responsibility for the accuracy or reliability of
any reproduction derived from the legislative material on its site. For all purposes of interpreting and applying the
law, consult the original and amending Acts as passed by Parliament (the "Assented to" Acts service, Part III of the
Canada Gazette and the annual Statutes of Canada) and the original and amending regulations as registered and
published in Part II of the Canada Gazette.

Everything else
